	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"マクシオン軍の新EXAMACS「アチェルビー」シリーズに「TYPE-C」が登場！",
			"• 素体となる本体のほか、アーマーパーツ、武器パーツがひとつになったオールインワンアイテム。",
			"• 肩や腰に接続可能なアーマーが2種付属。",
			"• 頭部バインダーを左右に展開することでシルエットが変化。",
			"• 頭部のバイザーは差し替えで上下に調整可能。",
			"• 付属のブレードサブマシンガンは、ブレード部分が分離。",
			"• 別売りのスピナティアに付属するアーマーを、カスタマイズ可能な胸部パーツが付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"\"TYPE-C\" is now available in Maxion's new EXAMACS \"Achelby\" series!",
			"• An all-in-one item that includes the main body, armor parts, and weapon parts.",
			"• Two types of armor that can be connected to the shoulders and waist are included.",
			"• The silhouette changes by unfolding the head binder from side to side.",
			"• The head visor can be adjusted up and down by replacing it.",
			"• The blade part of the included blade submachine gun is separated.",
			"• Comes with a chest part that allows you to customize the armor that comes with Spinatia (sold separately)."
		]
	},
